     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition specifying report titles, system
     A*   job date, dynamic page numbering, column headings, and detail row
     A*   field layouts with edit words (EDTWRD) and edit codes (EDTCDE).
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT2.RPGLE
     A*=========================================================================
     A
     A                                      REF(GTCSTP)
     A          R HEADING                   SKIPB(1)
     A                                     1DATE(*SYS *YY)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    23'GTC CUSTOMER ACCOUNTS'
     A                                    52'PAGE '
     A                                    57PAGNBR
     A                                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                      SPACEA(2)
     A                                     2'LAST NAME'
     A                                    17'CUSTOMER PHONE'
     A                                    32'CURRENT BILL AMT.'
     A                                    50'TOTAL AMOUNT OWED'
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A          R DETAIL                    SPACEA(1)
     A            CLNAME    R              2
     A            CPHONE    R             17EDTWRD('0(   )   -    ')
     A            CURBIL    R             32EDTCDE(J)
     A            AMTOWE    R             50EDTCDE(J $)
